 "summary": "A green, two-way screw-clamp terminal block for through-hole wave soldering, one row at 5.08 mm pitch, from the MKDS 1,5 family (COMBICON Terminals S line). Wires enter at 0° to the board into a screw connection with tension sleeve and slotted screw; each clamp takes one wire of 0.14 to 2.5 mm² solid (AWG 26 to 14) or two smaller ones. It is rated 17.5 A and 400 V (overvoltage category III, pollution degree 2), with one 0.9 × 0.9 mm solder pin per position, and latches side by side with other blocks of the family to build any position count.",
